{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-tourn-133"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817000-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 밀림 깊은 곳에 있고, 눈앞에는 넝쿨에 휘감긴 고대 신전이 있다","talkId":403817000,"textHash":"13821561063714323737","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817000","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f2270ce618c5a04","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817001-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817001-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"네스티아의 황금 고치에서 꽃이 피어나고, 조각상은 하얗게 퇴색되었으며, 나비에 둘러싸인 시인들은 돌계단 가장자리에 기대어 현을 튕기고 있다","talkId":403817001,"textHash":"15211259434734840066","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817001","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f2270ce618c5a04","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817002-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817002-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「당신의 슬픔에 귀 기울여요. 서풍의 끝자락, 시냇물처럼 교차하며 흐르는 눈물 같네요. 스틱시아의 해안가에서 당신의 사랑을 노래해요」","talkId":403817002,"textHash":"5341454054909894524","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817002","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f2270ce618c5a04","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817003-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817003-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그들의 시선이 당신에게 닿았다. 당신이 다시 눈을 떴을 때는 오직 알록달록한 나비 몇 마리만 있었다","talkId":403817003,"textHash":"12465542836170298085","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817003","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f2270ce618c5a04","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817004-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817004-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「나비들을 쫓아가야겠어」 당신의 마음속 갈망이 소리쳤다","talkId":403817004,"textHash":"14685170134816429824","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817004","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f2270ce618c5a04","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2096111672903299070-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"과거의 냄새를 맡는 나비를 쫓는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2096111672903299070","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-2096111672903299070","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"59e0e26a6c233eb8","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-1148380481922824363-effect"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-1148380481922824363-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물은 [사건] 구역과 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1148380481922824363","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-1148380481922824363","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"59e0e26a6c233eb8","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817005-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2096111672903299070-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817005-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"나비는 금실 한 올로 짠 방직을 찬미했다. 과거의 몸을 탈피한 신은 사랑을 찾는 여정에 올랐다","talkId":403817005,"textHash":"14133601485827380864","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817005","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"59e0e26a6c233eb8","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-11465773226877759551-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"전장을 가로지르는 나비를 쫓는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"11465773226877759551","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-11465773226877759551","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"34c6de835322995d","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-8571242971217914789-effect"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-8571242971217914789-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물은 [전투] 구역과 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"8571242971217914789","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-8571242971217914789","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"34c6de835322995d","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817007-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-11465773226877759551-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817007-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"나비는 크렘노스 국왕의 추락에 애도했다. 용감하지만 오만했던 전사는 적의 전차 바퀴에 깔리고 말았다","talkId":403817007,"textHash":"10063297654282291990","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817007","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"34c6de835322995d","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-6110668566900865085-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"영웅의 어깨에 있는 나비를 쫓는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"6110668566900865085","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-6110668566900865085","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9aa394fc3fdf29fa","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2083792275335466481-effect"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2083792275335466481-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물은 [조우] 구역과 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2083792275335466481","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-2083792275335466481","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9aa394fc3fdf29fa","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817009-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-6110668566900865085-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817009-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"나비는 꿀 음료 한 잔을 음미했다. 명예를 추구한 영웅들은 흔들리는 바다 위에서 잔을 들어 건배했다","talkId":403817009,"textHash":"6544096309348158384","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817009","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"9aa394fc3fdf29fa","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-7972084238944256417-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"우연히 만난 나비를 쫓는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"7972084238944256417","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-7972084238944256417","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0e507b547a79c656","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2198678552502820533-effect"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2198678552502820533-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"획득하는 기물은 [재물] 구역과 관련이 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2198678552502820533","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/text-2198678552502820533","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0e507b547a79c656","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817016-line"],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-7972084238944256417-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817016-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","missionId":"event-tourn-133","mission":"속삭이는 자","scene":"속삭이는 자","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"나비는 영원히 오지 않을 재회를 기다렸다. 금빛으로 찬란하던 시절, 시인은 황금의 고치의 권속과 우연히 만났다","talkId":403817016,"textHash":"13169222277182102007","source":"tournHandBookEvent:133/talk-403817016","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0e507b547a79c656","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"沉吟者","bwikiRevision":57867,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-17915","bwikiMission":"속삭이는 자"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817000-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817001-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817002-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817003-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817004-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2096111672903299070-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-1148380481922824363-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817005-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-11465773226877759551-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-8571242971217914789-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817007-line","divergent-universe